cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this protocol or its code, please cite the paper.
title: >-
  A Protocol for Robustness Benchmarking of Data-Driven Process Models
abstract: >-
  Seven measurement choices decide what a robustness benchmark for
  data-driven process models concludes. This repository holds the protocol
  implementation, the two system adapters, the simulator patches, and the
  per-episode errors the experiments produced.
authors:
  - family-names: Yu
    given-names: Xiyao
    affiliation: >-
      School of Chemistry, Chemical Engineering and Biotechnology,
      Nanyang Technological University, Singapore
license: MIT
type: software
keywords:
  - benchmarking
  - robustness
  - evaluation methodology
  - process control
  - Tennessee Eastman process
  - wastewater treatment
